# Copy to .env (gitignored).
#
# No DATABASE_URL here: tests get their database from scripts/dev/test-pg.sh (run them with
# scripts/dev/test.sh; aurora-testkit starts the same shared server when no URL is set). Never
# point a test at port 55432, the dev stack's database (`just dev-db`): the test kit refuses it.
# A script outside the tests that asks for DATABASE_URL (scripts/perf, some scripts/e2e) can be
# given the shared test server's: `scripts/dev/test-pg.sh up`, then `scripts/dev/test-pg.sh url`.
